title: DayTwoCherry
---

//Setting up the scene
<<ChangeLocation DialogueSignals "Cell">>
<<SetCharacterLocation DialogueSignals "Cherry" "Cell">>


Cherry:Ah. Good morning {$name} #expression:happy #pose:neutral

-> {$name}:Good morning Cherry!
    <<set $friendship +=1>>
-> {$name}:Hello
-> {$name}:(say nothing)
    <<set $friendship -=1>>

{$name}:So, how are you?

<<if $friendship >=4>>
Cherry:Honestly? I've been better. I won't lie, this isn't the most comfortable cell I've seen, these clothes are starting to itch a bit, and I've started talking to the walls for company. So, could be a bit better, I guess!
<<jump improvement>>
<<endif>>
<<if $friendship <4>>
Cherry:I'm doing perfectly well, thank you very much. What a lovely place for me to be staying in.#expression:neutral
<<jump improvement>>
<<endif>>

===
title: improvement
---
{$name}:Well maybe we can help each other out? Is there something I can do to improve your... living area? 
Cherry:Well depends. What would you want in return?#expression:neutral
{$name}:Just information. I want to know more about you, and how you ended up, the way you are.
Cherry:Well in that case... A new outfit would be nice. If you like.
-> Accept
    <<set $friendship +=1>> 
    {$name}:I'm sure I can figure something like that out for you. 
    Cherry:Thankyou, it is much appreciated. If I think of something worth sharing, you'll be the first I tell.#expression:happy
-> Decline
    <<set $friendship -=1>> 
    {$name}: Sorry, I don't think I can. 
    Cherry:Well. I see how it is then.#expression:sad #pose:sad


<<if $friendship >=6>>
Cherry:So... I've kind of heard others talking about what this place is. But like... what (do) you do?#expression:neutral #pose:neutral
{$name}:I'm security?
Cherry:No silly, as in this place?
{$name}:Oh! The Orion Institute is designed to study entities, such as yourself.
Cherry:Yeah, but why?
{$name}:Uh. I don't, actually know. Huh. #expression:neutral #pose:neutral
<<endif>>


Cherry:So, who runs this place? Who's brilliant idea was it to create an institute like this?

-> (truth)
    <<set $friendship +=1>>
    {$name}:Those are two different answers. The current director is {$Boss}, but the guy who created it is called Magnus Owens. He died a while back. But {$Boss} is pretty cool!
-> (avoid)
    {$name}:Well Magnus is the guy who created this place. But he's not the current director, that's someone else.
-> (lie)
    {$name}:Well the original director was a guy called Magnus, but I don't even know who owns it now. I've never met her.
    <<set $friendship -=1>>

Cherry:Magnus... now why does that name ring a bell?
{$name}:Maybe someone else has told you about him? He's quite famous around here, for obvious reasons.
Cherry:Hm. Maybe.
{$name}:...
{$name}:Can I ask you something?
Cherry:Shoot.#expression:happy #pose:neutral

-> Name
    <<jump name>>
-> Arrival
    <<jump arrival>>
-> Nevermind
    <<jump goodbye1>>
===

title: name
---
{$name}:Cherry. Is that a nickname?
Cherry:Uh. I... I don't know. I think so?#expression:pensive #pose:sad
Cherry:I can't quite remember.
{$name}:Huh, weird. If you ever do remember, I'd love to know.
<<jump goodbye1>>
===

title: arrival
---

{$name}:Do you remember much of how you got here? Or the day you arrived?
Cherry:Um. The day I arrived. I, uh, I don't remember. I think... I don't know. That's weird.#expression:neutral #pose:neutral
{$name}:Huh. Yeah, very weird.
<<jump goodbye1>>
===
//TODO: node name set to goodbye1 for now so I could do testing
title: goodbye1
---
//MC
{$name}:Well, it was good to talk to you again. You're a very interesting... person?
Cherry:Person will do. It's interesting talking to you too, {$name}. I suppose I will be seeing you again sometime soon.#expression:happy #pose:neutral
{$name}:Goodbye Cherry.
Cherry:Goodbye.

<<RemoveCharacter DialogueSignals "Cherry">>
<<SetCharacterLocation DialogueSignals "Scarlet" "Hallway">>

<<jump Navigating>>

===